    "text": "If the function $f(x)=2 x^{3}-9 a x^{2}+12 a^{2} x+1[a>0]$ attains its maximum and minimum at $p$ and $q$ respectively such that $\\mathrm{p}^{2}=\\mathrm{q}$, then $\\mathrm{a}$ is equal to",
